{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","title":"Run summary","description":"What RunSummary.build archives, and the only evidence G10 is allowed to reason from. This schema described a different document until 2026-09-07: result/phase_timings/human_waits/retries/review_findings/failure_signatures/resolutions/missing_knowledge/repeated_manual_operations/redacted_metrics, none of which the builder has ever produced. Nothing loaded it, so nothing noticed. It is wired into ArtifactStore.put now, which means it has to keep describing scripts/run_summary.py rather than an intention.","type":"object","required":["run_id","schema_version","terminal_state","outcome","metrics","approval_metrics","failure_groups","collaboration_receipt_count","pipeline_evidence_count","artifact_integrity_failures","content_hash"],"properties":{"run_id":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"schema_version":{"const":"1"},"terminal_state":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"outcome":{"enum":["SUCCESS","FAILED","TIMEOUT","IN_PROGRESS"]},"metrics":{"type":"object","required":["event_count","artifact_count","valid_artifact_count","external_receipt_count","unreconciled_intent_count"],"properties":{"event_count":{"$ref":"#/$defs/count"},"artifact_count":{"$ref":"#/$defs/count"},"valid_artifact_count":{"$ref":"#/$defs/count"},"external_receipt_count":{"$ref":"#/$defs/count"},"unreconciled_intent_count":{"$ref":"#/$defs/count"}},"additionalProperties":false},"approval_metrics":{"type":"object","required":["approved","rejected","pending","timed_out"],"properties":{"approved":{"$ref":"#/$defs/count"},"rejected":{"$ref":"#/$defs/count"},"pending":{"$ref":"#/$defs/count"},"timed_out":{"$ref":"#/$defs/count"}},"additionalProperties":false},"failure_groups":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","required":["signature","reason_code","count","examples"],"properties":{"signature":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"reason_code":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"count":{"$ref":"#/$defs/count"},"examples":{"type":"array","maxItems":3,"items":{"type":"string"}}},"additionalProperties":false}},"collaboration_receipt_count":{"$ref":"#/$defs/count"},"pipeline_evidence_count":{"$ref":"#/$defs/count"},"artifact_integrity_failures":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","required":["artifact_id","reason_code"],"properties":{"artifact_id":{"type":["string","null"]},"reason_code":{"type":["string","null"]}},"additionalProperties":false}},"content_hash":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$"}},"$defs":{"count":{"type":"integer","minimum":0}},"additionalProperties":false}
